      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alamo%2C_Indiana"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "High ground in Alamo drains east to Sugar Creek tributaries and west to Stillwater Creek, part of the Sugar Creek watershed.",
